ion":"Please note that the response to question 3 is missing. Kindly complete question 3 and resubmit the form.","notes":null},{"title":"Pavels Kozlovs - Criminal Record","tag":"Criminal Record","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-09-26","description":"Please note that the criminal record in the base application of Pavels Kozlovs (QPA/2024/01251) is not certified. Kindly upload a certified true copy of the criminal record in the base application QPA/2024/01251.","notes":null},{"title":"IT Soft Solutions N.V. - goAML Registration","tag":"Miscellaneous","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-09-26","description":"For the proof of goAML registration, please submit a screenshot of the admin page when logged in to the goAML portal. To do this, log in to the goAML portal, click Admin, select Active Organizations and take a screenshot of the page. Please upload the screenshot in the Extra Documentation section.","notes":null},{"title":"Nikoloz Lomia - Personal History Disclosure Form and Enclosures","tag":"Miscellaneous","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-11-12","description":"Please note that Nikoloz Lomia must be added as a Qualifying Person in the portal and the Personal History Disclosure Form and all enclosures must be uploaded.","notes":"Applicant reply: please advice which designation should be followed for entry in the listing, loan provider is not an option to select."},{"title":"Business Plan","tag":"Business Plan","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-11-12","description":"The business plan refers to the 'Broadway Platform'. Kindly provide detail/an executive summary about the relation of the applicant company and the platform.","notes":null},{"title":"Moris Varduashvili - Bank Reference Letter","tag":"Reference Letter","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-11-12","description":"Please note that the bank reference letter must be certified as a true copy. Please upload a certified bank reference letter in the base application QPA/2025/03643.","notes":null},{"title